  {
   "name": "Rotary Fold",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "organ",
   "tags": [
    "organ",
    "wavefolder",
    "per-voice pan"
   ],
   "description": "A drawbar organ through a sine wavefolder on every voice. Each note has its own rotor: a panning, slightly detuning LFO that starts at a random phase. The mod wheel (or macro 2) speeds the rotors up. Macros: fold, rotor speed, rotor depth.",
