  {
   "name": "Comb String",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "pad",
   "tags": [
    "comb",
    "karplus",
    "bowed"
   ],
   "description": "Noise bowing a comb filter tuned to each note, with a little saw for body: a bowed string that changes character with the comb's feedback polarity (macro 2). The bow noise is itself tuned to the note and a high shelf takes the hiss off the top, so it stays warm. Macros: resonance, polarity, air.",
