  {
   "name": "Fuzz Lead",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "lead",
   "tags": [
    "mono",
    "fuzz",
    "convolution",
    "cabinet"
   ],
   "description": "Two detuned saws through an asymmetric clipper (4x oversampled) after the filter, so the clipper sees every harmonic and the two saws grind against each other, then a 1×12 guitar cabinet (convolved) takes the fizz off. It starts as a crunch: the mod wheel turns it into full fuzz. Macros: fuzz, cutoff, cabinet.",
