  {
   "name": "Spring Twang",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "pluck",
   "tags": [
    "surf",
    "analog filter",
    "convolution",
    "spring",
    "tremolo"
   ],
   "description": "A twangy surf pluck: a narrow pulse and a saw through the clean-drive filter, pushed a little, with a snappy envelope, into a convolved spring reverb. Macro 1 brings in an amp tremolo. Macros: tremolo, spring, twang.",
