    "tempo sync"
   ],
   "description": "A per-note random LFO that takes a new value every 16th note jumps each note around the stereo field and moves its cutoff. Every note has its own random pattern, so a chord splits into independent lines. A little slew rounds the steps. Macros: jump, filter.",
